# Feedback Management Admin Panel

A MERN Stack feedback management admin panel built for the Full Stack Development exit examination. The project includes a responsive React frontend, a Node.js + Express backend, and MongoDB Atlas integration for CRUD operations on course feedback records.

## Features
- Dashboard for viewing feedback records
- Add feedback form with validation
- Update existing feedback records
- Delete feedback after confirmation
- Responsive admin panel design
- MongoDB Atlas integration using Mongoose
- API validation for required input and rating range

## Technologies Used
- React
- Vite
- React Router DOM
- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB Atlas
- Mongoose
- dotenv
- cors

